  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-12T12:40:04.119Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please allow us to create a Public instance that is a Cross Play world but only allow PC players to join so we don't need to use our ugly fallback avatars.  The same option could be available for Quest users to Create Quest only instances of cross play worlds.  I have no interest in spending hours and hours recreating my avatars for cross play after I already spend 100s of hours on them.  I really only want to hang out with PC users in my PC avatar and Quest can't see me anyway.  It's no fun that way.",
